{"created_at":"2026-10-03T22:11:08.525573Z","event_id":"evt_2d8980ceed504889a1ad3232e5b3d7f0","kind":"task_contract","operation_id":null,"payload":{"task":{"authority":{},"budgets":{"active_seconds":240,"model_attempts":12,"model_responses":12,"tool_actions":48},"criteria":[],"description":"Work through the provided tools to repair the project according to the task.\nExisting source files may be edited; tests are read-only. outline provides Python\nstructure; read_file provides exact numbered source. verify runs the fixed tests\nand returns full results in every condition. finish ends your attempt; acceptance\nis evaluated separately on a fresh snapshot using the original tests.\nAutomatic conditions run those same tests synchronously after each successful\nsource-changing edit. Check receipts and failures describe the check, not task\nacceptance. An unchanged edit or rejected edit does not run a hook. An execution\nerror, timeout or stale check must be investigated. Full evidence handles can be\nretrieved through read_output/search_output. Choose economical steps; finish once\nyou have evidence your implementation satisfies the task.\n\nCondition: Automatic checks return full test output after source-changing edits.\nTask: Implement the missing KVEntry and KVStore methods according to their docstrings. JSON snapshots are objects mapping string keys to string values; import merges them into the store without TTL. Preserve expiration and deletion contracts.\nFiles: engine.py, models.py, test_contract.py","schema_version":1,"task_id":"kv-automatic-full-noop"}},"schema_version":1,"sequence":1}
